<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT - Halifax valued at 660p/shr.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Halifax valued at 660p/shr.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Analysts at Dresdner Kleinwort Benson put a &quot;fair value&quot; estimate of 660p on shares in demutualising UK building society Halifax, market sources said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Analysts at the brokerage were not immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>Halifax, Britain's biggest mortgage lender, is due to make its market debut on June 2.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 4367</p>
</text>
